Stage saves: saved games at points of the story, for the scripted tests (a first line
"# save: NAME" in a script makes tests/run.sh start from tests/saves/NAME) and for human
testers (copy NAME and NAME.rsrc into the port's Saved Games folder, e.g. as "Hero" and
"Hero.rsrc", and give the copy the Finder type the Open dialog lists: delv_save.py set
NAME -o "Saved Games/Hero" does both).

They are made by tools/make_stages.py, the recipe for each: tools/delv_save.py edits do the
bookkeeping (a stronger hero, travel, the clock) and the game plays the rest for real
(fights, conversations, training), so the story state is the scenario scripts' own.
Rebuild them after engine or script changes with `tools/make_stages.py` ($CYTHERA = the
program); check them with `tools/delv_save.py check NAME` and `show NAME`.

odemia   Day 1, 10:06, in Odemia at Philinus's house (27,26).  The opening played through
         (Omen's Test, LandKing Hall, the World, the guard at the gate), then Eudoxus and
         his ruffians killed at the Abandoned Farmhouse, Ariadne freed from the cellar,
         brought to the gate (which opens) and to Philinus: quest "Rescue kidnapped
         Ariadne" done, story value 1 = 4 (the town open).  Edited: a strong hero (body 30,
         reflex 30, level 8, 250 health, Attack/Defense/Sword/Shield 10-12, sword,
         cuirass, helmet, light shield, boots, 100 oboloi).
         Good for: anything in Odemia (shops, townspeople, the next quests), save/load
         (tests/scripts/odemia.txt), selling (tests/scripts/sell.txt).

magic    From "odemia": in Pnyx at the Magisterium (10,45), trained in Mana and Casting by
         Lindus (quest "Learn Magic at Magisterium" done, story flag 1), who gave the
         grimoire; the spell Minor Embrightenment learnt with it from a scroll (the scroll
         edited in).  Magic 22/22; health 53 (training recomputes it).
         Good for: spells, magic training, Pnyx (tests/scripts/magic.txt).
